---
/**
 * CrossPromo.astro - a single ruled row pointing spirits buyers toward
 * Freezer Batch Cocktails. Shown on spirits calculator pages and on
 * bar-setup pages under the spirits line; never links back to the homepage.
 */
---

<div class="cross-promo">
  <p class="cross-promo-line">
    Batching cocktails ahead of time keeps the bar moving:
    <a href="https://freezerbatchcocktails.com/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Freezer Batch Cocktails</a>
    has make-ahead recipes that go straight from the freezer to the glass.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .cross-promo {
    padding: 14px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .cross-promo-line {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  .cross-promo-line a {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
